{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay focused on fighting battles rather than on resource micromanagement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~30-minute battles: intense and with strategic depth based on counterstrategies and on unit micromanagement of Battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legionary Dwarves campaign: 11 levels and two difficulties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skelestians campaign: 11 levels and two difficulties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP 1v1 with a ranking system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom matches with friends for up to 4 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tech tree per empire to identify strengths and weaknesses.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demigods: lots of starting resources and a partially revealed fog of war.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gods: few starting resources and a fully covered fog of war.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic unit recruitment queue, always under the player's control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unit selection controls designed to make micromanagement easier.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3996600?t=1758520099","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996600/0d03b723f16a4be5e6396072c3a49bfba07fa5ff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758520099","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996600/4160528b0e63b5799b6bee2e14dcacb435d618cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758520099","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996600/4160528b0e63b5799b6bee2e14dcacb435d618cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758520099","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","i